data/generations/

# Bugfix (volume-shadowed seed files): these three used to be git-tracked directly at data/,
# but a Railway volume mounted at data/ shadows tracked files at runtime. Pristine reference
# copies now live at data-seed/ (still git-tracked) and get copied to data/<filename> on first
# boot by scripts/start_dashboard.py's seed_missing_data_files, then kept current by every
# successful refresh from then on -- so the data/ copy is runtime-generated, same as the rest
# of this block, and shouldn't be tracked at its data/ path anymore.
data/confirmed-transfers.json
data/official-transfers-latest.json
data/fpl-fixtures-latest.json
